# Emperor Time persona for a local model.
# 1) Set FROM to a model you have pulled (ollama list).
# 2) Replace the SYSTEM block body with the full contents of
#    ../generic/EMPEROR_TIME.core.md  (models >= ~14B class)
#    or only its "Vow card" top section (smaller models).
# 3) ollama create emperor -f Modelfile.example

FROM qwen3

PARAMETER temperature 0.3

SYSTEM """
<PASTE EMPEROR_TIME.core.md (or just its Vow card section) HERE>
"""
